<title>INDONESIA: Suryamas 1996 net falls to 28.01 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Suryamas 1996 net falls to 28.01 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			28.01 vs 48.26</p>
<p>    Revenues			  61.42 vs 117.72</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    38.90 vs  73.71</p>
<p>    Operating profit		15.50 vs  55.58</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  32.69 vs  59.24</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     57.04 vs  36.49</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Suryamas Duta Makmur is a property firm.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
